WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
00:00.000 --> 00:01.490
[Characters, behaviors, places, organizations, professions, or events shown in the series

4
00:01.510 --> 00:02.790
are entirely fictional, solely for the purpose of entertainment,

5
00:02.810 --> 00:03.960
with no intention to instruct or promote any kind of behavior;

6
00:03.980 --> 00:04.980
viewer discretion is advised]

7
00:05.000 --> 00:06.830
Treasure your hearts well,

8
00:08.250 --> 00:09.150
for when the time comes,

9
00:09.430 --> 00:11.850
I shall reap them from both your chests.

10
00:12.430 --> 00:14.100
From now on,

11
00:14.670 --> 00:16.480
this dearest of yours will help ease your burden.

12
00:17.390 --> 00:19.290
I'll hold your hand

13
00:19.600 --> 00:20.210
and...

14
00:20.660 --> 00:22.630
stay by your side like this, always.

15
00:23.980 --> 00:25.630
I shall travel to Bangkok with you.

16
00:29.600 --> 00:30.540
Peem.

17
00:31.510 --> 00:32.710
You're home, my dear?

18
00:37.120 --> 00:37.770
Mom,

19
00:37.940 --> 00:38.630
this...

20
00:39.070 --> 00:40.160
is my girlfriend.

21
00:40.230 --> 00:41.030
Her name is Bulan.

22
00:41.730 --> 00:42.710
Hello.

23
00:52.170 --> 00:52.890
Peem,

24
00:54.430 --> 00:57.450
you're making decisions without even talking to me now.

25
00:59.490 --> 01:01.320
I just have a girlfriend, Mom.

26
01:01.890 --> 01:04.570
I've never caused anyone any trouble or harm.

27
01:07.730 --> 01:09.400
Why's everyone doing this to me?

28
01:10.180 --> 01:11.870
Everyone's going behind my back.

29
01:12.640 --> 01:15.980
What karma have I committed to deserve this?

30
01:17.430 --> 01:19.430
It's not like that, Mom.

31
01:23.090 --> 01:24.160
I still love

32
01:24.550 --> 01:26.200
and care for you, as I always have.

33
01:34.780 --> 01:35.460
So...

34
01:35.470 --> 01:36.800
how come you...

35
01:43.980 --> 01:45.020
Peem,

36
01:46.370 --> 01:47.490
don't you see

37
01:47.830 --> 01:49.780
how much I'm suffering?

38
01:51.190 --> 01:52.570
I do.

39
01:53.750 --> 01:54.810
I know.

40
01:55.670 --> 01:57.520
But I don't see how me being in a relationship

41
01:57.520 --> 01:59.530
has anything to do with it.

42
02:00.110 --> 02:02.940
I want you to focus on family first.

43
02:03.150 --> 02:05.350
Our family is in trouble, dear.

44
02:06.330 --> 02:07.590
As for the outsider,

45
02:07.860 --> 02:08.810
we'll deal with her later.

46
02:17.360 --> 02:18.830
Peem...

47
02:19.980 --> 02:22.350
If you really love me as you say you do,

48
02:23.480 --> 02:25.670
do as I ask,

49
02:27.290 --> 02:28.540
understood?

50
02:37.030 --> 02:37.780
Peem,

51
02:38.430 --> 02:39.430
follow me.

52
03:08.400 --> 03:12.690
♫Along with ghostly spirits hounding relentlessly,♫

53
03:12.690 --> 03:17.110
♫May the maras be ravaged and perish completely♫

54
03:17.330 --> 03:21.590
♫Vindictive spirits, tyrannical psyches,♫

55
03:21.590 --> 03:25.980
♫Meant to betray, slaughter, and invade,♫

56
03:25.980 --> 03:30.390
♫Were any souls to brush against my karmic soulmate,♫

57
03:30.390 --> 03:34.910
♫They shall bury the thought of returning to their realm♫

58
03:34.910 --> 03:39.010
♫With incantation and virtue as shield,♫

59
03:39.010 --> 03:43.490
♫At my feet, they shall surrender and kneel,♫

60
03:43.490 --> 03:49.610
♫Chanting, "Sadhu," of their own will♫

61
04:13.650 --> 04:15.040
I won't allow you

62
04:15.390 --> 04:16.610
to be in a relationship with that woman.

63
04:17.790 --> 04:19.980
Until I can be sure that she's right for you,

64
04:21.240 --> 04:22.980
you won't have my blessings.

65
04:23.710 --> 04:25.980
Her name is Bulan, not "that woman."

66
04:27.430 --> 04:28.670
If I told you

67
04:28.680 --> 04:30.640
that I'm happy being with her,

68
04:31.600 --> 04:33.770
would you let us be together?

69
04:35.030 --> 04:38.570
If you really think you're so happy being with her,

70
04:39.980 --> 04:41.260
then go.

71
04:43.030 --> 04:44.790
Don't show your face to me again.

72
04:46.770 --> 04:48.340
I suppose this house must have felt

73
04:49.210 --> 04:50.780
stifling all your life,

74
04:51.690 --> 04:53.500
if you've only just found happiness.

75
04:54.970 --> 04:57.180
And I must be horrible,

76
04:57.980 --> 05:00.290
so horrible in your eyes.

77
05:04.310 --> 05:07.260
If you feel uncomfortable having her here,

78
05:09.490 --> 05:11.100
then I'll go see Dad,

79
05:11.100 --> 05:13.420
and we'll take a trip back.

80
05:14.620 --> 05:16.430
I'm not uncomfortable, Peem.

81
05:17.690 --> 05:20.530
I just want my old daughter back.

82
05:22.210 --> 05:25.250
Who knows what kind of family that woman comes from?

83
05:25.800 --> 05:27.610
Don't think I didn't notice

84
05:28.340 --> 05:29.870
her tattoos,

85
05:29.980 --> 05:31.490
like those prostitutes have.

86
05:35.380 --> 05:37.510
Do you realize what you just said?

87
05:40.520 --> 05:43.040
If you two want to be happy together, be my guest.

88
05:44.300 --> 05:46.310
Leave me here alone.

89
05:46.910 --> 05:49.090
Don't give a single damn about me.

90
05:49.750 --> 05:51.690
Don't even show up at my funeral.

91
05:53.180 --> 05:54.590
And if you're going to visit your dad,

92
05:54.870 --> 05:56.600
tell him

93
05:57.020 --> 05:58.490
I'll agree to the divorce,

94
05:59.140 --> 06:01.590
and they can enjoy whatever happiness they want.

95
07:13.150 --> 07:14.390
What do you think you're doing?

96
07:18.240 --> 07:19.550
Aren't you a guest?

97
07:20.760 --> 07:22.900
You have no right to roam about

98
07:23.110 --> 07:25.510
without the homeowner's permission.

99
07:31.190 --> 07:33.210
Remind your guest

100
07:33.750 --> 07:37.030
that she shouldn't just walk into other people's rooms.

101
07:37.630 --> 07:39.440
Even though she is uneducated,

102
07:40.320 --> 07:41.740
she should know

103
07:41.890 --> 07:43.010
basic manners.

104
07:43.030 --> 07:44.930
I think you're taking it way too far.

105
07:45.610 --> 07:46.710
Not at all.

106
07:47.870 --> 07:49.890
I let you spend the night,

107
07:50.830 --> 07:52.050
but I didn't say

108
07:52.240 --> 07:53.730
you could roam around,

109
07:53.810 --> 07:55.740
acting like you own the place.

110
08:01.030 --> 08:01.910
Well,

111
08:02.920 --> 08:04.940
I'm sorry on Bulan's behalf, then.

112
08:06.040 --> 08:07.550
During our stay here,

113
08:08.180 --> 08:10.530
I'll make sure it never happens again.

114
08:12.350 --> 08:13.980
I have to go visit Dad.

115
08:14.280 --> 08:15.410
If you'll excuse me.

116
08:27.360 --> 08:30.280
[Noppawipol]

117
08:33.270 --> 08:34.100
Hello, Nop?

118
08:36.160 --> 08:37.830
I want to know

119
08:37.850 --> 08:40.070
about the woman my daughter brought home.

120
08:41.310 --> 08:42.670
Her name is Bulan.

121
08:43.810 --> 08:46.050
Whatever concerns her,

122
08:47.200 --> 08:48.640
you have to tell me everything.

123
09:03.150 --> 09:03.770
Here we are,

124
09:04.270 --> 09:05.980
at the condo where my dad lives.

125
09:08.150 --> 09:10.420
When Mom texted me that

126
09:10.690 --> 09:12.510
Dad had assaulted her,

127
09:12.750 --> 09:14.630
I didn't even believe it at first

128
09:15.830 --> 09:17.980
because I thought I knew my dad well enough,

129
09:19.150 --> 09:20.470
until...

130
09:21.370 --> 09:24.270
Mom sent photos of her injuries

131
09:24.290 --> 09:25.900
with bruises on her body.

132
09:27.100 --> 09:28.900
I don't understand

133
09:29.190 --> 09:31.310
why my dad would do it.

134
09:33.380 --> 09:36.310
Mortal minds are less fathomable than the deepest sea.

135
09:37.860 --> 09:39.880
At times, on mere impulse,

136
09:40.640 --> 09:42.390
they unknowingly

137
09:43.320 --> 09:44.440
commit an act...

138
09:44.460 --> 09:46.360
that they would regret for as long as they live.

139
09:56.440 --> 09:57.280
Hey...

140
09:58.760 --> 10:01.090
are you saying all this to make me feel better?

141
10:03.430 --> 10:05.220
Do my words

142
10:05.980 --> 10:08.670
bring you no comfort at all?

143
10:17.020 --> 10:18.650
Probably not with words,

144
10:20.430 --> 10:21.650
but...

145
10:22.200 --> 10:24.250
having you right by my side

146
10:24.690 --> 10:26.830
gives me so much peace of mind, my beloved.

147
10:29.430 --> 10:31.170
I'm sorry that...

148
10:32.110 --> 10:34.480
I brought you into such a messy family affair,

149
10:36.080 --> 10:37.980
and thank you...

150
10:40.150 --> 10:41.980
for being here for me at all times.

151
10:44.120 --> 10:45.980
I shall remain here forever.

152
11:17.330 --> 11:18.720
Who is it, Proud?

153
11:20.170 --> 11:21.650
They probably have the wrong room, babe.

154
11:23.030 --> 11:23.770
Not the wrong room.

155
11:24.290 --> 11:25.980
This is my little brother's room.

156
11:27.200 --> 11:28.980
Aren't you the one in the wrong room?

157
11:30.110 --> 11:30.910
You.

158
11:31.560 --> 11:33.570
You're Kin's oldest daughter, right?

159
11:35.680 --> 11:36.830
You're a cop,

160
11:36.960 --> 11:37.620
and your name is...

161
11:38.100 --> 11:38.990
Peem.

162
11:40.870 --> 11:43.190
Kin's told me so much about you.

163
11:43.800 --> 11:44.830
Let's get to know each other.

164
11:45.270 --> 11:46.650
We're probably seeing a lot more of each other.

165
11:47.610 --> 11:48.610
My name is Proud,

166
11:48.900 --> 11:50.400
Kin's new girlfriend.

167
11:51.810 --> 11:53.190
I have to say no.

168
11:53.480 --> 11:56.190
I choose my crowd carefully.

169
11:59.500 --> 12:00.900
You're just like your mother.

170
12:01.490 --> 12:03.900
I don't care who you are, where you came from,

171
12:03.920 --> 12:05.980
or what relationship you have with my father,

172
12:06.410 --> 12:09.300
but that's not how you should talk about my mom and me.

173
12:10.600 --> 12:11.220
Why?

174
12:11.650 --> 12:12.910
Who do you think you are?

175
12:13.010 --> 12:13.850
Why can't I talk about you?

176
12:13.870 --> 12:15.150
My mom and I aren't high and mighty,

177
12:15.820 --> 12:17.880
but we're not lowlifes like you, either.

178
12:18.790 --> 12:20.620
If you're a decent woman,

179
12:20.830 --> 12:23.980
you should've realized that what you're doing is wrong.

180
12:25.560 --> 12:27.460
But if you haven't figured that out,

181
12:28.790 --> 12:30.570
it's time you came to your senses.

182
12:30.590 --> 12:31.380
Wow, you bitch!

183
12:31.470 --> 12:32.430
Are you insulting me?

184
12:32.440 --> 12:33.340
Wanna fight?!

185
12:33.360 --> 12:34.120
Wait, Proud.

186
12:39.310 --> 12:40.040
Here,

187
12:41.400 --> 12:42.860
go shopping and calm down,

188
12:43.010 --> 12:43.660
please?

189
12:43.680 --> 12:44.830
I'll call you when I'm done.

190
12:53.410 --> 12:54.280
Thank you.

191
13:09.650 --> 13:10.740
Come on in, dear.

192
13:15.690 --> 13:16.630
My beloved,

193
13:17.840 --> 13:18.880
come on in.

194
13:29.550 --> 13:31.060
That woman was the reason

195
13:33.120 --> 13:34.890
you hurt Mom, wasn't she?

196
13:38.120 --> 13:39.670
It's not what you think, Peem.

197
13:41.030 --> 13:41.700
Well...

198
13:42.210 --> 13:44.110
Your mom always went off on me

199
13:44.930 --> 13:46.740
and dragged other people into it.

200
13:48.000 --> 13:49.410
She kept repeating the same thing,

201
13:49.660 --> 13:51.270
that I was the reason

202
13:51.970 --> 13:53.880
both Pat and Phu ended up that way.

203
13:56.000 --> 13:57.260
And when she found out about you,

204
13:57.700 --> 13:59.980
she barged in and attacked me.

205
14:00.400 --> 14:01.880
I told her to stop, but she wouldn't.

206
14:02.610 --> 14:04.050
What do you want me to do?

207
14:04.510 --> 14:06.350
I was just defending myself.

208
14:06.990 --> 14:08.840
But that's not a reason for you to...

209
14:12.990 --> 14:14.600
be with that woman.

210
14:17.890 --> 14:19.130
Mom said she'd divorce you.

211
14:20.850 --> 14:22.290
That's probably for the best.

212
14:24.090 --> 14:25.170
Being here

213
14:25.640 --> 14:27.230
gives me more peace of mind than being at home.

214
14:30.910 --> 14:31.490
Peem,

215
14:33.290 --> 14:34.490
listen to me.

216
14:35.690 --> 14:37.560
I'm not the only one who's changed.

217
14:38.400 --> 14:40.560
Your mom has changed, too.

218
14:40.890 --> 14:42.910
I shouldn't be the only one to blame here.

219
14:44.440 --> 14:47.030
I just couldn't tolerate how toxic she'd become anymore.

220
14:48.680 --> 14:50.930
Is that woman better than her?

221
14:58.310 --> 14:59.700
Did you actually choose her?

222
15:02.180 --> 15:03.610
She's not.

223
15:04.270 --> 15:05.320
But being with her...

224
15:06.770 --> 15:08.410
feels calming.

225
15:11.410 --> 15:12.810
I can't be without her.

226
15:14.790 --> 15:15.980
When Proud isn't around,

227
15:16.670 --> 15:17.810
my heart

228
15:18.290 --> 15:19.550
feels hot,

229
15:19.650 --> 15:20.940
like I'm dying.

230
15:24.100 --> 15:24.820
Peem...

231
15:25.810 --> 15:27.140
please understand me.

232
15:28.010 --> 15:30.010
After all this time, I've really tried,

233
15:32.470 --> 15:33.260
but in the end,

234
15:33.820 --> 15:36.570
I had to choose my own peace.

235
15:42.230 --> 15:44.960
If you're choosing your own peace,

236
15:46.970 --> 15:49.280
I won't stand in your way.

237
15:51.160 --> 15:52.340
I know too well...

238
15:54.730 --> 15:58.730
that you've probably been through so much pain.

239
16:00.400 --> 16:03.170
If, one day, you find your sanctuary

240
16:03.290 --> 16:05.610
and decide to stay there,

241
16:09.300 --> 16:11.450
I'll understand completely,

242
16:17.510 --> 16:19.230
because if I were in your place,

243
16:20.460 --> 16:23.190
I'd want to find somewhere I could feel at peace, too.

244
16:26.170 --> 16:27.480
I'm sorry, Peem.

245
16:41.980 --> 16:43.700
I'm sorry, too, Dad.

246
17:36.300 --> 17:37.790
I am parched.

247
17:37.850 --> 17:40.080
May I trouble you for a glass of water, Father?

248
17:41.670 --> 17:43.270
I forgot to introduce her.

249
17:43.340 --> 17:44.610
This is Bulan,

250
17:45.430 --> 17:47.060
my girlfriend.

251
17:54.890 --> 17:55.510
Then...

252
17:55.870 --> 17:57.050
I'll get her a glass of water.

253
17:57.070 --> 17:58.380
It's okay. I'll get her one.

254
17:58.400 --> 17:59.350
It's fine, Peem.

255
17:59.600 --> 18:01.120
It's better if I handle this, alright?

256
18:01.200 --> 18:03.080
Stay with your girlfriend here.

257
18:16.690 --> 18:17.980
Is everything okay?

258
18:18.500 --> 18:19.080
My dearest,

259
18:19.140 --> 18:20.640
search the bedroom with haste.

260
18:20.830 --> 18:22.370
Seek under the pillows and in the drawers.

261
18:22.560 --> 18:25.210
Should you notice anything unusual, do tell me at once.

262
18:28.400 --> 18:30.290
You're saying that...

263
18:30.800 --> 18:32.440
From the instant I set foot in this domain,

264
18:32.440 --> 18:33.980
I have caught sight of strange dark shadows.

265
18:35.710 --> 18:37.070
Still, you should go inspect.

266
18:37.320 --> 18:39.200
It might not be what I imagined.

267
19:25.250 --> 19:33.620
(Incanting)

268
20:49.420 --> 20:50.190
Peem,

269
20:50.590 --> 20:52.090
what are you doing in my bedroom?

270
20:53.010 --> 20:53.610
And...

271
20:53.990 --> 20:55.380
And what's that behind you?

272
20:56.600 --> 20:57.980
Nothing, Dad.

273
20:58.200 --> 20:59.110
I'm just...

274
20:59.200 --> 21:01.980
grabbing some stuff I forgot in Phu's room.

275
21:02.640 --> 21:03.350
Some stuff?

276
21:03.690 --> 21:04.990
What stuff? Show me.

277
21:05.980 --> 21:07.880
I think we should go outside.

278
21:07.900 --> 21:09.540
My girlfriend's waiting. Let's go.

279
21:09.650 --> 21:10.810
Give it back to me!

280
21:12.080 --> 21:13.120
Give it back!

281
21:33.650 --> 21:35.300
You always meddle in my fucking business.

282
21:35.920 --> 21:37.800
Like mother, like daughter!

283
22:02.110 --> 22:07.980
(Incanting)

284
22:17.310 --> 22:18.020
My dearest,

285
22:18.040 --> 22:19.070
are you well?

286
22:28.410 --> 22:30.510
I told you to inspect it, not rob it.

287
22:30.530 --> 22:32.290
And who taught you to seize it with your own bare hands?

288
22:38.290 --> 22:38.950
Here.

289
22:42.190 --> 22:51.980
(Incanting)

290
23:13.350 --> 23:15.290
(Incanting)

291
24:04.300 --> 24:06.310
The arts of cursed dolls

292
24:06.930 --> 24:08.490
bind two souls in fabricated love,

293
24:08.630 --> 24:10.610
causing them to linger forever

294
24:11.330 --> 24:13.280
at the user's behest.

295
24:15.190 --> 24:17.750
Father, that woman has cast black magic upon you.

296
24:24.040 --> 24:25.800
As for Madam Ratchapee,

297
24:26.090 --> 24:27.920
I cannot yet say.

298
24:28.250 --> 24:30.450
Upon thorough inspection,

299
24:31.080 --> 24:33.800
I may be able to discern its origin and source.

300
24:34.960 --> 24:36.180
You're saying...

301
24:36.570 --> 24:39.010
Mom was cursed with black magic, too?

302
24:42.220 --> 24:44.370
You yourself have no shortage of foes.

303
24:44.780 --> 24:47.080
Though you have vanquished them all,

304
24:47.420 --> 24:49.470
you have also been cursed with such magic.

305
24:50.600 --> 24:53.270
I am not saying that what occurred to Mr. Pakin

306
24:53.390 --> 24:55.320
was the doing of those who loathe you.

307
24:56.260 --> 24:57.680
Still, we cannot lay down our arms.

308
24:59.600 --> 25:01.510
When Dad said...

309
25:01.830 --> 25:04.220
that Mom had become a different person,

310
25:07.450 --> 25:08.630
I actually...

311
25:09.000 --> 25:10.870
felt it, too,

312
25:11.460 --> 25:14.190
but I didn't want to be fully convinced

313
25:14.790 --> 25:16.650
before I could find proof.

314
25:17.890 --> 25:18.690
Then...

315
25:19.680 --> 25:20.990
let's go back and prove it

316
25:23.650 --> 25:24.890
so we can be sure

317
25:26.250 --> 25:27.040
whether that's

318
25:27.730 --> 25:28.690
the case or not.

319
25:34.360 --> 25:34.890
Alright.

320
25:51.160 --> 25:53.120
Go back through whatever door you came in.

321
25:53.240 --> 25:54.990
I don't want you setting foot here.

322
25:56.320 --> 25:57.170
Mom,

323
25:57.710 --> 25:59.030
please listen to me.

324
25:59.190 --> 26:00.260
Dad's been

325
26:00.390 --> 26:02.240
under a black magic spell all this time, Mom.

326
26:02.810 --> 26:04.100
Besides,

327
26:04.190 --> 26:06.130
you might have been, too.

328
26:06.510 --> 26:07.980
Please let me help you, Mom.

329
26:07.980 --> 26:09.370
You're the one

330
26:09.500 --> 26:11.030
who's been cursed with black magic.

331
26:11.690 --> 26:13.110
I've already looked into

332
26:13.400 --> 26:15.500
who this woman is.

333
26:18.600 --> 26:19.770
The reason my daughter is like this

334
26:20.880 --> 26:22.080
is you, right?!

335
26:22.100 --> 26:23.280
Stop it, Mom.

336
26:24.840 --> 26:26.860
I wasn't cursed with black magic.

337
26:26.890 --> 26:28.190
I love her!

338
26:28.960 --> 26:29.610
You...

339
26:30.550 --> 26:32.110
You must listen to me.

340
26:33.490 --> 26:35.270
You can love whoever you want, regardless of gender.

341
26:35.290 --> 26:36.900
I have never been against that,

342
26:37.340 --> 26:40.050
but I draw the line at crazy shamans like this!

343
26:40.070 --> 26:42.490
She's not a shaman the way you think she is.

344
26:43.310 --> 26:44.480
She helps people,

345
26:44.500 --> 26:46.220
and she even helped Dad!

346
26:47.700 --> 26:48.640
There it is.

347
26:49.290 --> 26:50.470
Because of this woman,

348
26:51.300 --> 26:52.930
everyone's going insane!

349
26:55.200 --> 26:56.800
You really don't get it.

350
26:57.120 --> 27:00.120
She's been helping me capture the criminals, Mom.

351
27:01.280 --> 27:03.860
I'd bet my life on it.

352
27:05.610 --> 27:07.890
She never does that to me, Mom.

353
27:09.030 --> 27:10.560
The more you say this stuff,

354
27:10.890 --> 27:12.430
the more obvious it is

355
27:12.450 --> 27:15.090
that I've been right all along!

356
27:15.250 --> 27:17.810
You're the one who's been cursed with black magic!

357
27:19.900 --> 27:22.550
I've been raising my child since she was born.

358
27:22.820 --> 27:25.480
She's never talked back to me, not even a word.

359
27:42.420 --> 27:43.750
What am I to do

360
27:44.340 --> 27:45.500
to make you believe

361
27:46.000 --> 27:48.070
I have never once borne your daughter ill will?

362
27:51.200 --> 27:53.380
Get out of my daughter's life.

363
27:55.430 --> 27:56.970
That way, I can be sure

364
27:57.190 --> 27:59.740
you won't cast any foul magic on my daughter.

365
28:01.710 --> 28:02.660
Do you have the guts to?

366
28:04.240 --> 28:05.110
No, my beloved.

367
28:05.920 --> 28:06.720
Mom,

368
28:06.900 --> 28:08.220
I'm begging you.

369
28:09.000 --> 28:11.010
Please don't do this to me, Mom.

370
28:17.530 --> 28:18.170
Mom,

371
28:18.560 --> 28:19.810
I'm begging you.

372
28:20.140 --> 28:22.480
I really can't live without her.

373
28:26.220 --> 28:28.010
Until the lady is at peace,

374
28:30.190 --> 28:31.880
do not ever come before me again.

375
28:38.730 --> 28:39.910
I give you my word

376
28:40.300 --> 28:42.890
that I shall not brush against your child, Madam Ratchapee,

377
28:43.620 --> 28:44.990
until you can be certain

378
28:45.410 --> 28:47.200
that my love is nothing but pure.

379
28:55.400 --> 28:57.800
The debt of gratitude owed to parents reigns supreme.

380
28:58.400 --> 29:00.370
I take this matter to heart, and you know it well.

381
29:02.510 --> 29:03.900
No...

382
29:05.390 --> 29:06.820
I have already given her my word.

383
29:07.500 --> 29:09.220
It is an oath.

384
29:11.080 --> 29:12.620
Were you to come to me in secret,

385
29:12.650 --> 29:14.190
you would be deemed a mara,

386
29:15.400 --> 29:16.840
causing me to break my oath.

387
29:19.540 --> 29:21.750
And we shall never love again...

388
29:22.370 --> 29:23.640
in this lifetime.

389
29:24.070 --> 29:25.110
No, my beloved.

390
29:26.140 --> 29:27.860
Please don't leave me, my beloved.

391
29:28.900 --> 29:29.660
Please don't.

392
29:32.220 --> 29:33.090
Please, my beloved.

393
29:33.630 --> 29:34.500
I'm begging you.

394
29:34.960 --> 29:35.590
My beloved.

395
29:41.160 --> 29:42.180
I give you my word.

396
29:51.290 --> 29:52.260
Peem, come back!

397
29:52.280 --> 29:53.320
Don't go, Peem!

398
29:53.760 --> 29:54.950
Peem, come back!

399
29:55.100 --> 29:56.000
Peem!

400
30:02.820 --> 30:04.700
Do not force me to break my oath.

401
30:11.030 --> 30:13.000
Are you really going to leave me?

402
30:16.800 --> 30:18.280
Could you please not leave me?

403
30:22.860 --> 30:24.620
I have waited for you my whole life.

404
30:25.930 --> 30:28.690
That we have met means destiny has led us to cross paths.

405
30:30.710 --> 30:32.040
But if this is as far

406
30:32.610 --> 30:34.360
as our past merit takes us,

407
30:35.380 --> 30:37.260
then so be it.

408
30:44.950 --> 30:46.730
Without you,

409
30:47.350 --> 30:49.980
I wouldn't have been able to do this.

410
30:50.650 --> 30:51.770
Anyway,

411
30:53.070 --> 30:53.980
thank you

412
30:55.100 --> 30:56.800
for being here and helping me.

413
30:58.950 --> 31:01.480
No matter what comes our way,

414
31:01.490 --> 31:02.320
or...

415
31:02.690 --> 31:05.340
no matter how much things change,

416
31:06.340 --> 31:07.370
I'm confident that

417
31:08.120 --> 31:12.150
I will hold your hand like this forever, as your dearest.

418
31:17.520 --> 31:18.780
Your mother

419
31:19.540 --> 31:21.100
is in distress.

420
31:22.040 --> 31:24.740
Her need of you far surpasses mine, my dearest.

421
31:27.520 --> 31:29.110
May you be blissful,

422
31:31.690 --> 31:33.440
and may your path never be touched by sorrow.

423
31:34.440 --> 31:35.380
No, my beloved...

424
31:37.100 --> 31:39.950
Didn't you promise we'd walk a long way together, hand in hand?

425
31:41.120 --> 31:43.390
Why are you leaving me like this, my beloved?

426
31:50.090 --> 31:51.980
I really can't live without you.

427
31:57.160 --> 31:57.980
No...

428
31:58.070 --> 31:59.310
I'm not letting you go.

429
31:59.480 --> 32:00.200
No...

430
32:09.740 --> 32:14.360
♫What if, between us,♫

431
32:14.650 --> 32:19.960
♫It's nothing but a perfect illusion,♫

432
32:19.980 --> 32:23.570
♫Nothing short of deception?♫

433
32:23.600 --> 32:28.540
♫What I've kept hidden for ages,♫

434
32:28.560 --> 32:33.660
♫Do you know how painful it is♫

435
32:33.670 --> 32:41.330
♫To keep my heart locked away in a cage?♫

436
32:57.740 --> 33:00.700
"This incantation shall help Mrs. Ratchapee

437
33:00.780 --> 33:02.390
return to her usual self."

438
33:16.970 --> 33:17.570
Peem,

439
33:17.590 --> 33:18.890
where are you taking me?

440
33:19.200 --> 33:21.150
I'm taking you to the bedroom

441
33:21.490 --> 33:23.900
to search for what you're hiding.

442
33:27.760 --> 33:29.980
That way, I can get my mom back.

443
33:35.640 --> 33:36.550
You're the one

444
33:36.780 --> 33:37.980
who's been cursed with black magic.

445
33:43.400 --> 33:44.740
You believe every word she says.

446
33:44.820 --> 33:45.980
You do whatever she wants,

447
33:46.590 --> 33:47.840
letting her lead you by the nose.

448
33:47.930 --> 33:49.390
What am I supposed to think?

449
33:49.510 --> 33:50.700
Then, whatever you want me to prove,

450
33:50.720 --> 33:51.760
just say it.

451
33:52.170 --> 33:53.090
Take me to

452
33:53.110 --> 33:56.390
any sanctum you think could lift the curse from me.

453
33:56.870 --> 33:58.300
I'll go anywhere.

454
33:58.760 --> 34:00.620
I'll do everything you say.

455
34:01.510 --> 34:02.910
Calm... I think you should calm down.

456
34:03.220 --> 34:04.490
Let's talk it out,

457
34:04.520 --> 34:05.190
you and her.

458
34:05.220 --> 34:06.450
You just be quiet!

459
34:06.760 --> 34:08.150
Your good-father act

460
34:08.170 --> 34:10.470
ended the day you brought that bitch home.

461
34:11.500 --> 34:12.460
Sure.

462
34:13.280 --> 34:14.860
Prepare yourself, Peem.

463
34:15.190 --> 34:16.400
Starting tomorrow,

464
34:16.680 --> 34:19.110
I'm going all out on you.

465
34:37.370 --> 34:38.400
Is this the place

466
34:38.890 --> 34:41.490
you believe will help me?

467
34:43.140 --> 34:44.490
You said it yourself

468
34:44.820 --> 34:46.570
that you'd prove it to me,

469
34:47.340 --> 34:49.220
so that means no questions,

470
34:49.280 --> 34:50.370
no doubts.

471
34:50.810 --> 34:52.380
Just do as I say.

472
35:01.820 --> 35:02.440
This...

473
35:02.640 --> 35:04.050
is called "Liak Dok,"

474
35:04.730 --> 35:05.820
a ritual to examine the body

475
35:05.840 --> 35:08.250
and draw out any inauspicious influences.

476
35:09.620 --> 35:12.070
If the egg cracks open to reveal black goop, then that means...

477
35:13.290 --> 35:15.380
she has definitely been cursed with black magic.

478
35:48.090 --> 35:49.500
This girl

479
35:50.040 --> 35:52.100
has someone watching over her.

480
35:52.840 --> 35:55.220
She has not been cursed or put under any spell.

481
35:56.200 --> 35:57.410
Impossible.

482
35:58.140 --> 36:00.420
It's clear that she's been cursed with black magic.

483
36:00.770 --> 36:02.980
If you're not capable of helping my daughter,

484
36:02.980 --> 36:04.460
don't make excuses.

485
36:04.910 --> 36:07.000
And don't think you can swindle me out of my money again.

486
36:24.330 --> 36:25.240
That was my mistake

487
36:25.820 --> 36:27.780
for bringing you to this shaman, Peem.

488
36:30.180 --> 36:32.360
Are you gonna believe me now?

489
36:32.490 --> 36:33.270
No,

490
36:33.820 --> 36:34.880
I'm not.

491
36:35.290 --> 36:37.150
Just because we couldn't find it doesn't mean it's not there.

492
36:37.180 --> 36:39.030
This kind of magic is incredibly tricky.

493
36:39.430 --> 36:41.540
If a shaman couldn't fix it,

494
36:41.920 --> 36:44.320
I'm gonna turn to Buddhism to save you.

495
36:44.520 --> 36:46.300
I called your grandmother

496
36:46.710 --> 36:47.690
to tell her you'll be

497
36:47.720 --> 36:50.040
practicing Dhamma with her for seven days and seven nights.

498
36:51.130 --> 36:52.790
Go home, pack your things,

499
36:53.180 --> 36:55.920
and leave for Ranong tonight to see your grandmother.

500
36:59.690 --> 37:00.290
Mm,

501
37:00.800 --> 37:01.620
of course.

502
37:02.490 --> 37:04.360
If that's gonna give you peace of mind

503
37:04.360 --> 37:06.510
and make you listen to me for a change,

504
37:08.460 --> 37:09.980
I'll go.

505
37:33.580 --> 37:34.660
Are you hungry?

506
37:35.770 --> 37:37.960
You have been practicing here for seven days,

507
37:37.980 --> 37:40.890
yet I have not seen you eat a single bite.

508
37:43.240 --> 37:44.460
Your face

509
37:45.480 --> 37:47.020
looks pale and drawn,

510
37:47.230 --> 37:48.550
and your skin

511
37:49.210 --> 37:50.870
is all dry, dear.

512
37:51.740 --> 37:53.020
Would you like to eat something?

513
37:57.120 --> 37:58.470
No, Grandma.

514
37:59.820 --> 38:00.980
I'm not hungry.

515
38:06.680 --> 38:07.980
Can you tell me

516
38:09.430 --> 38:10.550
who they are,

517
38:11.490 --> 38:12.970
what their name is,

518
38:13.460 --> 38:14.790
and what they are like?

519
38:15.210 --> 38:17.410
Can you tell me about them?

520
38:22.790 --> 38:23.470
Yes.

521
38:27.310 --> 38:29.980
Miss Chanwara Kritpirat.

522
38:30.820 --> 38:32.540
Everyone calls her...

523
38:32.900 --> 38:35.110
- Master Bulan. - Right.

524
38:35.130 --> 38:37.980
She lives in Phop Phra, Tak province.

525
38:39.910 --> 38:41.690
She has...

526
38:42.210 --> 38:43.230
a gorgeous face,

527
38:43.640 --> 38:44.680
just like...

528
38:45.080 --> 38:48.350
a lotus gently bathed in soft moonlight.

529
38:49.400 --> 38:50.990
In reality...

530
38:51.710 --> 38:54.070
she's a very kind person.

531
38:54.650 --> 38:56.150
She's decisive,

532
38:57.610 --> 38:58.470
and...

533
38:58.820 --> 39:00.150
she holds virtues dear

534
39:00.450 --> 39:02.540
while preaching virtues like you do.

535
39:03.390 --> 39:05.190
She likes getting up to cook

536
39:05.220 --> 39:07.240
even before sunrise

537
39:07.560 --> 39:09.270
so she can offer alms to the monks.

538
39:10.480 --> 39:11.760
On her days off,

539
39:12.630 --> 39:14.870
she likes going to the temple to make merit,

540
39:15.420 --> 39:16.460
and...

541
39:17.130 --> 39:19.980
everything she cooks is delicious, Grandma.

542
39:21.580 --> 39:23.680
As for the housework,

543
39:24.390 --> 39:26.870
she's never once fallen short.

544
39:30.040 --> 39:31.470
I believe that

545
39:31.760 --> 39:34.070
if you get to know Bulan,

546
39:34.760 --> 39:36.340
you'll fall in love with her

547
39:36.370 --> 39:37.980
like I did.

548
39:39.000 --> 39:39.770
Alright.

549
39:46.080 --> 39:47.050
I believe you.

550
39:51.900 --> 39:53.020
Actually,

551
39:53.500 --> 39:56.130
she has a red birthmark just like mine,

552
39:56.250 --> 39:57.980
in the exact same spot.

553
39:58.180 --> 39:59.070
But...

554
39:59.400 --> 40:00.370
if...

555
40:00.770 --> 40:02.420
we bring our hands together,

556
40:02.990 --> 40:05.200
they form a perfect heart.

557
40:06.340 --> 40:08.720
Master Bulan told me that

558
40:11.870 --> 40:15.160
it's a sign of two people who are karmic soulmates, Grandma,

559
40:17.740 --> 40:18.420
two people...

560
40:19.590 --> 40:21.710
who can't be severed.

561
40:23.000 --> 40:24.990
I couldn't really believe it.

562
40:25.690 --> 40:27.240
Master said that...

563
40:27.530 --> 40:29.070
we wouldn't be separated,

564
40:29.750 --> 40:31.030
but I'm wondering why she and I

565
40:31.030 --> 40:33.250
have to be separated like this, Grandma.

566
40:39.120 --> 40:40.270
Hang in there, dear.

567
40:41.210 --> 40:42.180
Hang in there.

568
40:43.700 --> 40:45.520
Karmic soulmates

569
40:46.100 --> 40:48.120
are bound to be together no matter what.

570
40:48.780 --> 40:49.810
Trust me.

571
40:53.900 --> 40:55.020
Trust me, alright, dear?

572
40:55.040 --> 40:56.060
Hang in there.

573
40:56.570 --> 40:57.280
Alright,

574
40:57.860 --> 40:59.080
I will.

575
40:59.140 --> 40:59.740
Sure.

576
41:00.300 --> 41:01.620
I believe that in the end,

577
41:01.980 --> 41:04.220
I'm gonna find my way to her, no matter what.

578
41:11.900 --> 41:13.540
I miss her, Grandma.

579
41:14.500 --> 41:16.160
I bet she misses you, too.

580
41:39.540 --> 41:41.780
You let yourself drown in melancholy,

581
41:43.180 --> 41:45.620
refusing to eat a single meal.

582
41:47.160 --> 41:48.970
When you are like this,

583
41:49.000 --> 41:50.100
it worries me, dear Bulan.

584
41:51.070 --> 41:53.500
How could I bear to return to the temple?

585
42:14.560 --> 42:16.800
Keep it within bounds, dear Bulan.

586
42:17.420 --> 42:19.980
Many people still wish to rely upon you.

587
42:21.540 --> 42:22.960
Should you fall so ill

588
42:23.370 --> 42:24.770
that you must close the sanctum,

589
42:26.730 --> 42:29.680
you are not the only one who would suffer.

590
43:00.740 --> 43:01.440
Ow!

591
43:02.280 --> 43:03.080
My beloved!

592
43:04.290 --> 43:05.480
Do you find it pleasing?

593
43:06.780 --> 43:07.860
If so,

594
43:07.980 --> 43:10.920
I shall turn them into a potpourri for you to cherish.

595
43:11.520 --> 43:13.240
Whenever the scent greets you,

596
43:14.190 --> 43:16.860
you shall dream of me by your side without end.

597
43:28.790 --> 43:29.490
Peem,

598
43:30.150 --> 43:33.190
can you stop protesting by refusing to eat or drink?

599
43:42.720 --> 43:44.950
Are you trying to kill me with a broken heart?

600
43:46.860 --> 43:48.400
Are you satisfied?

601
43:51.710 --> 43:53.870
Are you going to believe me now?

602
43:54.120 --> 43:54.810
Not yet.

603
43:56.220 --> 43:58.050
Get up, take a shower, and get dressed.

604
43:58.830 --> 44:00.710
I'm taking you to a psychiatrist

605
44:00.790 --> 44:02.530
to get you thoroughly examined, Peem.

606
44:02.550 --> 44:03.750
Quick, get up!

607
44:04.450 --> 44:05.170
Peem, get a move on.

608
44:05.200 --> 44:05.770
Come on, get up.

609
44:05.800 --> 44:06.920
Trust me. Get up.

610
44:07.800 --> 44:08.440
Peem.

611
44:10.240 --> 44:11.260
Peem, let me see that.

612
44:11.280 --> 44:11.980
What's this?

613
44:12.520 --> 44:13.500
What is this?

614
44:13.670 --> 44:14.490
What is this, Peem?

615
44:14.510 --> 44:15.520
Let me have it, Mom.

616
44:15.840 --> 44:16.830
- Peem, give it to me. - Please give it back.

617
44:16.970 --> 44:17.710
What's this?

618
44:18.040 --> 44:19.880
Tell me what this is, Peem!

619
44:40.470 --> 44:41.980
Let me go!

620
44:43.300 --> 44:44.700
Let me go!

621
44:47.230 --> 44:48.200
Let me go!

622
44:50.130 --> 44:51.500
What are you doing, huh?

623
44:54.150 --> 44:54.920
Peem!

624
44:56.280 --> 44:58.280
Thip, let my granddaughter go at once!

625
45:06.060 --> 45:07.560
Take it slow, dear.

626
45:12.070 --> 45:13.830
Thip, get water to douse it!

627
45:19.890 --> 45:20.450
Peem,

628
45:20.780 --> 45:21.520
you're gonna burn your hands!

629
45:21.540 --> 45:22.640
No, they're gonna blister!

630
45:22.730 --> 45:23.290
Peem!

631
45:23.310 --> 45:24.170
They're gonna blister, dear!

632
45:24.670 --> 45:25.460
Peem...

633
45:28.040 --> 45:28.920
Peem, don't do that.

634
45:28.950 --> 45:30.300
Your hands are gonna blister, dear.

635
46:03.020 --> 46:04.120
As I said afore,

636
46:04.200 --> 46:05.560
I shall do the laundry myself.

637
46:07.130 --> 46:08.280
It's okay.

638
46:08.560 --> 46:10.190
I'm happy to do it for you.

639
46:10.300 --> 46:10.890
Hey,

640
46:11.060 --> 46:12.760
I may not look it,

641
46:12.990 --> 46:15.130
but I'm really good at doing laundry.

642
46:15.360 --> 46:16.460
Look at this.

643
46:17.410 --> 46:17.980
Here,

644
46:18.730 --> 46:19.980
the stains

645
46:20.000 --> 46:21.240
are nowhere to be found.

646
46:42.100 --> 46:43.800
Who are you? Where do you come from?

647
46:44.990 --> 46:46.260
My name is Phon,

648
46:46.880 --> 46:48.590
I am a curry and rice vendor.

649
46:48.610 --> 46:50.650
I took a train here from Lop Buri.

650
46:51.000 --> 46:53.880
I have heard that you are a kind-hearted soul,

651
46:53.980 --> 46:56.980
always keen to help vendors' businesses thrive

652
46:57.160 --> 46:58.600
and bring in

653
46:58.750 --> 46:59.920
enough money for...

654
47:00.350 --> 47:02.710
a family to...live comfortably.

655
47:04.390 --> 47:06.980
I would like your help, Master.

656
47:07.510 --> 47:09.120
The sanctum is already closed for the day.

657
47:09.250 --> 47:10.370
Do take your leave, dear Phon.

658
47:10.400 --> 47:11.010
Uh...

659
47:11.730 --> 47:13.970
I know the sanctum is closed,

660
47:14.260 --> 47:16.170
but I beg you, Master,

661
47:16.200 --> 47:17.990
to show me mercy and help me.

662
47:18.410 --> 47:20.790
I truly am at my wit's end.

663
47:21.040 --> 47:23.750
I have nowhere left to turn.

664
47:27.280 --> 47:29.100
I truly cannot oblige today.

665
47:30.540 --> 47:31.830
And where

666
47:32.440 --> 47:33.980
shall you stay tonight, dear Phon?

667
47:34.800 --> 47:35.490
Uh...

668
47:35.670 --> 47:37.900
I do not know myself.

669
47:38.360 --> 47:40.230
I have no money,

670
47:40.660 --> 47:43.330
so I was thinking of resting at

671
47:43.350 --> 47:44.330
a roadside pavilion.

672
47:44.770 --> 47:47.750
Once the Master's sanctum opens, I will be back.

673
47:48.490 --> 47:50.960
How could you seek a night's rest at a pavilion?

674
47:51.220 --> 47:52.660
That is dangerous.

675
47:53.900 --> 47:55.080
Dear Phon...

676
47:55.350 --> 47:57.420
do spend the night here.

677
47:59.670 --> 48:00.890
What say you,

678
48:01.000 --> 48:02.050
dear Bulan?

679
48:19.660 --> 48:21.770
Do eat at your leisure, dear Phon.

680
48:21.980 --> 48:23.680
No one shall rob you of it.

681
48:23.880 --> 48:24.810
Mm!

682
48:25.690 --> 48:27.330
I have truly never had kaeng hang le

683
48:27.350 --> 48:29.540
this delicious before!

684
48:36.680 --> 48:37.370
Uh...

685
48:39.980 --> 48:41.920
while the sanctum is still closed,

686
48:43.190 --> 48:45.140
might I trouble you...

687
48:46.330 --> 48:47.220
to teach me the culinary arts

688
48:47.460 --> 48:49.940
so that I may earn my own living, Master?

689
48:50.950 --> 48:52.420
I concur.

690
48:53.180 --> 48:55.590
Do teach her to make four or five dishes.

691
48:56.250 --> 48:57.210
Master,

692
48:57.240 --> 48:59.110
I have some money left.

693
48:59.190 --> 49:01.140
I will give it all to you!

694
49:01.920 --> 49:03.250
But if that is not enough,

695
49:03.270 --> 49:04.920
I will find you more.

696
49:05.030 --> 49:06.160
Anyway,

697
49:06.520 --> 49:08.150
when it comes to cleaning the house,

698
49:08.180 --> 49:09.840
I can do it all.

699
49:09.860 --> 49:11.380
I don't mind it at all, Master.

700
49:14.310 --> 49:16.670
It is not that I trust strangers,

701
49:18.090 --> 49:19.450
but dear Phon

702
49:20.090 --> 49:22.880
- does seem innocuous. - Right.

703
49:23.980 --> 49:26.590
Were there someone to keep you company,

704
49:27.690 --> 49:29.630
I should be at ease.

705
49:36.090 --> 49:37.040
That's right.

706
49:39.420 --> 49:41.720
Pray, do treasure your money.

707
49:41.890 --> 49:43.020
You need not bestow it upon me.

708
49:43.740 --> 49:45.700
As for the culinary arts,

709
49:46.030 --> 49:47.390
I do not teach them.

710
49:50.760 --> 49:52.380
However, if you are keen to learn,

711
49:52.860 --> 49:54.620
you must endeavor to do so.

712
49:56.400 --> 49:57.140
Sure thing.

713
49:57.540 --> 49:58.240
Uh...

714
49:58.870 --> 50:01.400
I've always been quick to catch on, Master.

715
50:01.680 --> 50:03.110
Whatever you do,

716
50:03.740 --> 50:05.980
I can observe and pick it up, right?

717
50:15.000 --> 50:15.690
Uh...

718
50:16.300 --> 50:18.310
Did something happen to her?

719
50:21.390 --> 50:22.990
Ever since she was sundered from her love,

720
50:23.810 --> 50:26.130
she can neither eat nor seek her bed, and has fallen ill.

721
50:28.450 --> 50:31.030
I could still sense the gloom

722
50:31.720 --> 50:33.850
she smothers within.

723
50:36.390 --> 50:37.980
Don't you worry, Venerable Mother.

724
50:38.400 --> 50:40.470
I will take care of her.

725
50:40.700 --> 50:41.960
Very good care indeed.

726
50:41.980 --> 50:44.400
I will consider her my very own granddaughter,

727
50:44.550 --> 50:45.350
alright?

728
51:51.720 --> 51:53.360
It is done, dear Phon.

729
51:54.650 --> 51:55.750
All done?

730
52:07.460 --> 52:08.860
Mm, the food

731
52:08.880 --> 52:10.560
looks so appetizing!

732
52:10.910 --> 52:13.380
And everything I've tasted is delicious.

733
52:13.400 --> 52:14.690
Once I return home,

734
52:14.720 --> 52:16.060
I'm gonna cook them and sell them.

735
52:16.080 --> 52:17.960
Oh, they're going to sell like hotcakes!

736
52:17.980 --> 52:19.980
I'm sure gonna be wealthy this time around.

737
52:21.560 --> 52:22.800
Aren't you gonna eat, Master?

738
52:24.140 --> 52:26.200
Do eat. No need to tarry for me.

739
52:27.190 --> 52:27.820
Alright.

740
52:35.120 --> 52:35.880
Ooh...

741
52:36.950 --> 52:37.980
Master,

742
52:38.620 --> 52:41.270
you have a red birthmark.

743
52:44.080 --> 52:46.920
We've known each other for many days, but I've only noticed it now.

744
52:47.620 --> 52:49.290
I know someone

745
52:49.400 --> 52:51.980
who has a red birthmark exactly where you have it.

746
52:56.980 --> 52:58.030
Let's dig in.

747
52:59.240 --> 53:00.130
Dear Phon,

748
53:00.660 --> 53:02.310
pray, speak truthfully

749
53:02.690 --> 53:04.470
about your true intentions

750
53:04.750 --> 53:05.830
in approaching me.

751
53:06.490 --> 53:08.410
I just wanted to learn...

752
53:08.680 --> 53:11.610
the culinary arts to make a living.

753
53:11.640 --> 53:13.630
I truly have no ulterior motives.

754
53:17.590 --> 53:18.350
Very well.

755
53:19.120 --> 53:21.480
Whatever motives you bear,

756
53:22.330 --> 53:24.510
I deem you a good soul,

757
53:25.610 --> 53:27.190
rich in merit and virtue.

758
53:28.180 --> 53:29.750
I shall allow you to stay.

759
53:32.220 --> 53:34.570
When the time comes, I'll leave right away.

760
53:35.530 --> 53:36.740
Thank you very much.

761
53:38.470 --> 53:39.400
Master,

762
53:39.880 --> 53:41.270
you're burning up.

763
53:44.890 --> 53:46.060
So hot.

764
53:47.320 --> 53:48.360
Goodness, Master.

765
53:48.410 --> 53:49.420
I am well.

766
53:50.510 --> 53:50.990
Oh!

767
53:53.000 --> 53:54.280
How are you feeling, Master?

768
53:59.410 --> 54:00.810
Why don't you go get some rest?

769
54:04.470 --> 54:05.400
I am well.

770
54:06.490 --> 54:07.290
Alright, alright.

771
54:08.850 --> 54:09.580
Look at you.

772
54:09.910 --> 54:12.230
You can barely take care of yourself.

773
54:13.240 --> 54:15.840
How are you gonna help others in this state,

774
54:15.860 --> 54:16.970
Master?

775
54:19.550 --> 54:20.970
I can wipe myself down.

776
54:21.000 --> 54:22.260
No can do.

777
54:22.280 --> 54:24.050
Stay still, Master.

778
54:24.330 --> 54:26.980
You're this sick, yet you insist on doing things yourself.

779
54:27.160 --> 54:28.990
There's no need. I'll take care of you.

780
54:29.510 --> 54:30.760
Actually,

781
54:31.050 --> 54:32.760
I was thinking about going home tomorrow,

782
54:32.820 --> 54:34.220
but seeing as how you're sick,

783
54:34.940 --> 54:36.340
I can't bring myself to.

784
54:38.560 --> 54:39.520
Dear Phon,

785
54:39.580 --> 54:41.530
pray you, return to tend to your affairs.

786
54:42.550 --> 54:43.980
Worry not about me.

787
54:45.180 --> 54:46.300
It's fine.

788
54:46.740 --> 54:48.260
Just stay still and take it easy.

789
54:48.280 --> 54:49.750
I will bring a change of clothes for you.

790
55:10.250 --> 55:11.770
Look, this lotus,

791
55:12.070 --> 55:14.300
I embroidered it with my own hands.

792
55:15.050 --> 55:16.010
Do you like it, dear?

793
55:17.420 --> 55:18.510
I do.

794
55:19.200 --> 55:20.230
By the way,

795
55:20.760 --> 55:23.670
why does it have to be a lotus?

796
55:24.230 --> 55:25.370
Well...

797
55:25.890 --> 55:28.390
when you were small, you went to make merit with me, right?

798
55:28.660 --> 55:29.660
And you said that

799
55:29.710 --> 55:32.000
you adored lotuses the most,

800
55:32.250 --> 55:34.050
that they embodied purity,

801
55:34.130 --> 55:35.530
beauty,

802
55:35.800 --> 55:37.020
preciousness,

803
55:37.220 --> 55:38.120
and...

804
55:38.440 --> 55:39.060
uh...

805
55:39.110 --> 55:40.200
dignity.

806
55:40.780 --> 55:41.980
Thank you, Grandma.

807
55:42.440 --> 55:43.320
You're welcome.

808
56:06.660 --> 56:08.790
My lower garments are to the left.

809
56:10.250 --> 56:11.560
As for the right side...

810
56:11.910 --> 56:13.430
let it be, dear Phon.

811
56:15.810 --> 56:16.440
Alright.

812
56:44.150 --> 56:46.250
Mom, Mom.

813
56:47.750 --> 56:48.440
Thong...

814
56:54.920 --> 56:55.710
Thong.

815
57:07.930 --> 57:09.900
How come you never visited?

816
57:11.030 --> 57:13.600
Do you know how much I miss you, Thong?

817
57:14.310 --> 57:15.460
I could not come.

818
57:15.480 --> 57:17.110
If Mommy finds out, she will punish me.

819
57:17.360 --> 57:18.710
She told me that

820
57:18.720 --> 57:20.960
the oath must be upheld;

821
57:21.270 --> 57:22.690
thus, I cannot seek you out

822
57:22.720 --> 57:25.020
or come to see you under any circumstances.

823
57:25.090 --> 57:26.510
The reason I am here

824
57:26.590 --> 57:29.890
is that the deity Bhummaso listened to your prayers

825
57:29.920 --> 57:31.980
and came to seek me.

826
57:36.680 --> 57:38.120
And how's Mommy doing?

827
57:40.120 --> 57:41.900
Is she doing fine, Thong?

828
57:52.360 --> 57:53.700
It's okay, Thong.

829
57:53.780 --> 57:54.980
No matter what...

830
57:55.520 --> 57:57.590
please take good care of her for me.

831
57:58.850 --> 58:00.090
Mom promises that

832
58:00.300 --> 58:02.250
Mom's gonna find her way back to Mommy.

833
58:07.340 --> 58:08.060
Thong,

834
58:10.420 --> 58:13.350
can I ask you to do something for me?

835
58:48.600 --> 58:49.820
Thong, what ails you?

836
58:52.640 --> 58:55.000
"Please do this for Mom, Thong."

837
59:11.270 --> 59:13.700
I pray that,

838
59:15.590 --> 59:17.840
if any merits I have made

839
59:17.860 --> 59:19.980
still remain,

840
59:20.860 --> 59:22.790
fate...

841
59:23.720 --> 59:26.400
may not be so cruel to me.

842
59:28.830 --> 59:31.930
May you take me back to Phop Phra

843
59:33.980 --> 59:36.620
while I'm still breathing.

844
59:37.680 --> 59:41.140
Should any sacred deities have mercy on me,

845
59:41.980 --> 59:44.630
let there be no walls in our way,

846
59:45.980 --> 59:48.940
and let no one

847
59:50.600 --> 59:53.260
ever separate us again.

848
01:00:53.110 --> 01:00:54.220
I would like to tell you

849
01:00:54.240 --> 01:00:56.160
that this will be the end of it.

850
01:00:56.320 --> 01:00:58.390
If I agree to let

851
01:00:58.410 --> 01:01:01.980
a phony exorcist perform an exorcism on me this time,

852
01:01:02.000 --> 01:01:03.600
you will believe me, right?

853
01:01:06.430 --> 01:01:08.140
Dear vital spirits,

854
01:01:08.890 --> 01:01:11.400
wherever you may be, may you return

855
01:01:11.980 --> 01:01:13.550
to my dearest karmic soulmate.

856
01:01:17.130 --> 01:01:19.770
Dare you set foot upon the late master's sanctum?

857
01:01:38.040 --> 01:01:41.520
♫It's not that I don't feel it♫

858
01:01:41.540 --> 01:01:45.250
♫It's not that I'm cold-hearted♫

859
01:01:45.270 --> 01:01:48.970
♫For the love you've given♫

860
01:01:51.880 --> 01:01:55.370
♫It's because it feels too good to be true,♫

861
01:01:55.400 --> 01:01:58.920
♫So much so that I doubt if it's true♫

862
01:01:58.940 --> 01:02:05.640
♫If it's smoke and mirrors, a dream that lingers♫

863
01:02:05.690 --> 01:02:11.780
♫Deeply swayed by love, all while shaken with dread,♫

864
01:02:11.800 --> 01:02:18.270
♫Scared that it's not love after all in the end♫

865
01:02:19.140 --> 01:02:24.110
♫What if, between us,♫

866
01:02:24.130 --> 01:02:29.400
♫It's nothing but a perfect illusion,♫

867
