♫Nothing short of deception?♫

868
01:02:33.050 --> 01:02:37.860
♫What I've kept hidden for ages,♫

869
01:02:37.880 --> 01:02:43.050
♫Do you know how painful it is♫

870
01:02:43.070 --> 01:02:49.980
♫To keep my heart locked away in a cage?♫

871
01:03:01.400 --> 01:03:05.060
♫Can you so gently give me some time,♫

872
01:03:05.080 --> 01:03:08.530
♫For me to ponder what's on my mind?♫

873
01:03:08.550 --> 01:03:15.290
♫I would hate to be wavering when love binds♫

