881
01:03:56.120 --> 01:04:01.290
♫To keep my heart locked away in a cage?♫

882
01:04:01.310 --> 01:04:06.580
♫Tell me it's not an illusion you beautifully created♫

883
01:04:06.600 --> 01:04:13.460
♫Don't let my heart suffer and ache inside this cage♫

884
